WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:13.040
You can Synchro Summon by using this card 
in the graveyard and a non-Tuner Monster.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.990
It's a Synchro Summon from the graveyard!

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:16.610
My turn.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.800
I summon Trap Reactor•Y FI!

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:25.550
Then I activate Diving Exploder's 
monster effect from my hand!

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:30.620
I send this card in my hand to the graveyard.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.650
The attack and defense points of monsters on

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:36.650
the field are switched 
until the end of this turn!

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:40.890
What?  Switch the attack and defense points?

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:45.700
There's no way a non-Signer can defeat me!

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:48.090
Go, Diving Exploder!

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:01.620
Trap Reactor•Y FI, 
shoot him with RR Cannon!

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:11.600
Why am I feeling an impact?

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.720
Everyone…

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:19.440
Crow?

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:20.570
Crow!

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:29.200
I can't afford to lose!

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:31.440
Everyone!

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:32.840
I…

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:53.680
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:58.780
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:03.690
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:08.460
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:13.820
No matter how bad today is

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.800
There's still the faintest light

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:24.210
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:28.270
Is light it myself

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:33.280
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:38.250
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:44.550
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:48.530
Today will never exist again

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:54.430
So I won't stop or vanish

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:23.530
Beyond the Emotions Created by the Cards

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:29.990
Who's geoglyph is it?

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.990
It's too dangerous ahead!  I'm going alone!

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:35.160
What?

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.390
It's fine, Yusei!

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:42.230
Even if we enter the geoglyph, I can protect 
Ushio and Lua as long as I stay with them.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:45.160
That's right!  We're a team, Yusei!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.390
We're going with you!

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:48.750
Fine.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.640
I'll go ahead and find the duelists.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:53.500
Follow me later!

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.170
Who's dueling?

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:25.340
I refuse to lose!

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.380
He's tough.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.380
He managed to stay on the course.

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:45.530
I set one card and end my turn.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:49.680
Diving Exploder's effect 
switched Trap Reactor•Y FI's

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:53.680
attack and defense points, but 
they now return to normal.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:56.010
This really is a shadow Riding Duel!

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.740
The impacts I feel are powerful!

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:01.420
You don't understand.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:05.230
You risk your life in a battle 
against the Dark Signers.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:08.380
Yusei, you were right.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:11.740
I'm risking my life in this Riding Duel.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:12.990
But...

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:16.990
Their regrets are much worse!

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:20.330
I won't be scared!

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.730
Here comes my counterattack!

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:24.940
Here I go!  It's my turn!

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:31.480
From my hand, I activate the 
Speed Spell Angel Baton!

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:36.550
I can activate this card when I 
have 2 or more Speed Counters.

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:38.550
I draw two cards from my deck!

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:42.250
Then I discard one card from my hand!

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:46.900
I summon Blackwing – Mistral the 
Silver Shield in defense position!

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:57.600
When there's a Blackwing monster on my 
field, I can Special Summon this from my hand!

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:58.510
Come!

00:05:58.510 --> 00:06:01.660
Blackwing – Bora the Spear!

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:06.510
He instantly summoned two monsters.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:09.030
Go, Bora the Spear!

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:11.580
Attack Trap Reactor•Y FI!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.350
Death Spiral!

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:27.000
Did I win?

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:36.760
That wasn't enough to faze him.

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:37.480
What?

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.690
His monster wasn't destroyed?

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:46.420
I activated this card before you attacked!

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:50.420
The trap card Fake Explosion!

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:56.140
When you attacked my monster, this 
card protected it from destruction!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:07:00.140
Then I can Special Summon Summon 
Reactor•SK from my hand!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.040
What?

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:08.170
Everything I did improved his status.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.210
This is bad.

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:15.220
Since he has Trap Reactor and Summon Reactor,
the next one will be Spell Reactor•RE.

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.520
If he gathers all three...

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:25.190
...he'll summon Flying Fortress SKY FIRE, his ace 
monster that punished Yusei during the Fortune Cup.

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:27.430
If he does that, I'll lose!

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:29.600
I have to do something.

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:36.780
The power of a shadow Riding Duel 
definitely caused this destruction.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:38.480
That means they're nearby.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.240
There they are!

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:47.710
I'm dueling against a non-Signer.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:51.720
Of course I'll win!  This duel is mine-

00:07:58.340 --> 00:07:59.500
Yusei!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.920
Did you say Yusei?

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.330
Crow, it was you?

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:07.210
Bommer?

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.200
Those eyes…

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:11.940
Bommer, you can't be...

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:13.940
That's right, Yusei.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:20.520
In order to get my revenge against Godwin, 
I've resurrected with Dark Signer power!

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:26.250
Just wait, Yusei!  Since you're 
Godwin's minion, you're also my enemy!

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.200
Bommer…

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.890
Crow, stop this duel immediately!

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:33.900
Let us handle it!  The Signers will 
duel against the Dark Signers!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:38.240
Yusei, even though this request is 
coming from you, I can't accept!

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:48.110
Due to the Dark Signers, all 
the kids at my home are gone!

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:49.340
What?

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:51.050
The children?

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:56.060
I will get my revenge!

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:58.670
Even you can't stop me!

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:00.020
Crow!

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:02.120
They were my hope!

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:05.250
They were me!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:09.910
My parents died 17 years ago in an accident.

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:18.060
For as long as I can remember, I was 
wandering around Satellite with nowhere to go.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.400
I was alone.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.630
I had no friends.

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:26.020
No one loved me.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:29.040
It was pathetic.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:33.040
I always had to search for 
food and a place to sleep.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:10:01.020
But Duel Monsters saved me.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:19.230
Show me!
What cards do you have?

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:24.470
I never went to school.  
No one ever taught me.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:28.940
I was a kid who couldn't 
read, write or do math.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:33.750
But I learned them all from Duel Monsters.

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:38.420
Creativity, knowledge, wisdom…

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:42.150
Duel Monsters gave that to me.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:48.480
Even though I had no money or schooling, 
Duel Monsters gave me friends.

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:52.200
Then I met Yusei and Jack.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.040
By the time I realized, 
I was no longer alone.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:11:02.300
Duel Monsters were magical cards 
that freed me from my prison.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:08.970
There are many kids like me at Satellite.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:13.880
I want to share with them 
what Duel Monsters taught me.

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:19.390
I want to let them know that they 
have friends that will help them.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:27.730
I don't want anyone have to feel how I felt!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:33.940
Crow…

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:38.380
But the Dark Signers...

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:51.260
They turned my hopes into dust!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:53.490
You won't get away with this!

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.490
Bring it, Crow!

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:58.990
The darkness in your heart wants revenge!

00:11:58.990 --> 00:11:59.500
Stop it!

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:02.450
Crow and Bommer, you have to stop!

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.440
You both have scars on your hearts!

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:10.140
So you must understand how the other feels!

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:11.350
Bommer!

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:16.850
Even if you're a Dark Signer, I know 
you still care about your hometown!

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:22.670
When we looked up at the sky to find our

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:26.970
future, I know we weren't 
looking for a battle, Bommer!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:30.290
Then where can we point our anger?

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:31.810
Crow!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.300
Revenge only creates more revenge!

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:35.900
Why can't you understand that?

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:41.130
My head understands, but my heart doesn't!

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:42.040
Crow!

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.470
Please understand, Yusei!

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:48.240
We have to fight!

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:55.070
If you're my friend, then watch 
our duel with your own eyes!

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:00.300
Crow…

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:02.930
Fine!

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:06.660
I'll watch your duel!

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.200
Yusei…

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:11.660
Then let's continue the duel!

00:13:14.930 --> 00:13:16.820
Bring it, Bommer!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:37.150
Here I go!  My turn!

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:44.580
I summon Spell Reactor•RE from my hand!

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:53.310
Then I activate Summon Reactor•SK's effect!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.780
Summon Reactor!

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:56.600
Spell Reactor!

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.050
Trap Reactor!

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:00.690
I send the three Reactors to the graveyard!

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:04.450
Bommer's ace monster is coming!

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:09.730
I Special Summon this monster from my deck!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:17.030
Appear, Flying Fortress SKY FIRE!

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:22.700
That giant freak appeared!

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:27.240
I activate Flying Fortress SKY FIRE's effect.

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:31.350
Once a turn, by sending a card 
in my hand to the graveyard...

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:34.340
I can destroy one card on your field.

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:38.400
I destroy Mistral the Silver Shield!

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:40.020
Sharpshooting!

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:50.430
Then Flying Fortress SKY 
FIRE attacks Bora the Spear!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.170
Death Air Raid!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.870
Bora the Spear!

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:05.880
Mistral the Silver Shield's effect activates!

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:13.990
When this monster is destroyed this 
turn, I take 0 battle damage once!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:18.100
You dodged it.

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:21.430
I end my turn!

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:24.130
He's really tough.

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:28.880
I can see why Yusei had a hard time 
against him during the Fortune Cup.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:34.640
If I didn't know Flying Fortress SKY 
FIRE's effect, I would've taken damage.

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:38.860
If I don't do something about it 
soon, there's no way I can win.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:40.850
My turn!

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:46.950
Due to Flying Fortress SKY FIRE's effect...

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:52.990
...he can destroy my summoned monster or Set card,
and I take 800 points of damage.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:55.600
I know what I have to do!

00:15:55.890 --> 00:16:00.800
I summon Blackwing – Vayu the 
Emblem of Honor in defense position!

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:07.630
It's no use!

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:14.050
The instant you summon your new monster, I 
activate Flying Fortress SKY FIRE's effect!

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:21.220
Once during your turn, I destroy your 
summoned monster, and you take 800 points of damage!

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:22.930
Death Drop!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:30.860
Crow!

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:41.020
I managed to survive!

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:47.070
But if Crow keeps taking those 
impacts, his stamina will run out.

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:49.650
The battle is just beginning!

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:53.200
You don't even have a monster.  
There's nothing you can do!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:56.100
No, this was what I was aiming for!

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:59.970
Vayu the Emblem of Honor's effect activates!

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:06.990
By removing this card and one non-Tuner 
Monster in my graveyard from play,

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:09.100
I can Synchro Summon!

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:11.740
Synchro Summon from the graveyard?

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:20.820
I tune Elphin the Raven 
and Vayu the Emblem of

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:24.520
Honor by removing them from 
play from the graveyard!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:28.590
Black wind, turn into wings 
that rise to the heavens!

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:30.390
Synchro Summon!

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:33.400
Blackwing Armor Master!

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:42.550
When there's a Blackwing monster on my 
field, I can Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:46.270
Come, Blackwing – Gale the Whirlwind!

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:51.650
You expected Flying Fortress SKY FIRE 
to destroy Vayu the Emblem of Honor.

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:54.060
That allowed you to Synchro 
Summon from the graveyard

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:57.060
and use a monster effect to have 
two monsters on your field.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:02.030
But they have less attack points 
than Flying Fortress SKY FIRE!

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:03.640
Don't underestimate me!

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:07.860
Armor Master attacks 
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE!

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:09.970
You've lost your mind, Crow!

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:14.740
Armor Master will be destroyed 
because it has less attack points!

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.170
We'll see about that!

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:18.640
Go, Armor Master!

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:21.460
Black Hurricane!

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:26.110
This strategy is…

00:18:29.110 --> 00:18:31.470
Armor Master isn't destroyed?

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:32.860
Too bad!

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:37.730
Armor Master isn't destroyed in battle, 
and battle damage becomes zero!

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:42.070
Then what's the point of attacking?

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:47.110
I stuck it with a wedge!

00:18:47.110 --> 00:18:48.510
A wedge?

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:51.510
Armor Master's effect activates!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:57.910
By removing a Wedge Counter 
from a monster, its attack and

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:02.910
defense points become zero until 
the End Phase of this turn!

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:05.690
What?

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:09.670
Gale the Whirlwind, attack 
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE!

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:29.130
Bommer!

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.340
How's that, Yusei?

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:36.840
Even though I'm not a Signer, 
I can fight a Dark Signer!

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.130
Don't let your guard down, Crow!

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:39.950
Bommer won't lose that easily!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:48.130
His D-Wheel is incredible!

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:53.230
How dare you, Crow!

00:19:54.940 --> 00:20:01.040
With Speed World, you lose 1 Speed Counter 
for every 1000 points of damage you take at once!

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:04.250
Now you can't catch up to me!

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:08.020
I set one card and end my turn!

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:13.440
If I can't catch up to you, 
then I'll pull you back to me!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.080
My turn!

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:24.200
Where there are no monsters on my field, I 
can Special Summon this card from my graveyard!

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:30.910
Appear, Dark Tuner Doom Submarine!

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:36.880
You summoned a Level 9 monster 
without paying a cost?

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:38.850
I've had enough of your unfair effects!

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:42.210
I can do this because I have 
the power of the afterlife!

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:45.290
Then I summon Darksea Rescue!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:55.770
Level 9 Doom Submarine dark 
tunes Level 1 Darksea Rescue!

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:06.180
I hear the lament from 
the depths of darkness!

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:10.030
Wear the grim reaper's 
armor and show yourself!

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:13.710
Dark Synchro!

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:24.030
Appear, Dark Flattop!

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:34.770
Dark Flattop…

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:39.310
Just because it's big 
doesn't make it special!

00:21:57.140 --> 00:22:01.610
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:01.970 --> 00:22:06.680
We will build our own future

00:22:07.150 --> 00:22:12.120
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:17.290
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:22.890 --> 00:22:32.430
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:38.000
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.070 --> 00:22:42.710
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:47.980
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:47.980 --> 00:22:52.450
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:52.650 --> 00:22:58.030
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.160 --> 00:23:02.910
This journey has no end

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:08.370
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:08.800 --> 00:23:13.610
Hear my voice
